Hi,

Below is the high-level schedule (what topics on which
days) for the next PWG face-to-face in Vancouver, BC 
on Monday-Thursday (24-27 May 2004).

Claudia - since the conference is on US/Canadian Pacific 
Daylight Savings Time, it's possible that I will be able
to attend that Tuesday's JTAPI during a PWG lunch break.

Interesting topics for FSG Open Printing include:

- The proposed new PWG Standard Imaging System Events 
  (schema available now, draft spec in near future),
  material extracted from IETF IPP Notifications spec 

- The proposed new PWG Simple Job Ticket (non-XML) for
  consumer electronics devices to submit print requests
  via removable media (memory card, DVD), direct connect
  (USB, parallel), or network interface (IEEE 802.11,
  Ethernet).
  (draft spec available within the next week)

Cheers,
- Ira


