Greetings All,

The PWG Registration page is now available at
https://www.ieee-isto.org/pwg/registration.html. Please register to attend
the upcoming May 24-27, 2004 meetings in Vancouver, BC.

There is a daily attendance fee of US$55.00. (Payments are processed on the
first day of the meeting series.)  This fee is to cover food/beverage and
meeting accomodations at the Delta Suites.

The deadline for reserving sleeping accommodations at the Delta Vancouver
Suites is May 14, 2004.  Please call the reservation hotline toll-free at
+1-800-268-1133 or local number +1-604-689-8188 to make your reservations.
Please make sleeping room reservations by May 14, 2004. Please ask for the
Printer Working Group Rate.

The agenda for the meetings has been tentatively finalzed as well.  Please
see below:

Monday - WBMM
Tuesday - Plenary (morning - with time for PSI Last Call review); PWG
process last call review including Semantic Model process and aux documents
such as file naming (afternoon)
Wednesday - Semantic Model Extensions (morning); Standard Imaging Systems
Events (afternoon)
Thursday - Consumer (8:30-11:30); Transform Services Interface Introduction
(12:30 - 3pm)

If you have any other questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to
contact me at any time.

With Kindest Regards,
~Ami

